### Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&limit=20&role=USER&status=ACTIVE&plan=FREE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123",
  "displayName": "New User",
  "role": "USER",
  "plan": "FREE"
}

### Get user (includes credit summary)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### User activity timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/activity?limit=30&types=audit,credit,session
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Change role (SUPER_ADMIN only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "REVIEWER"
}

### Reset password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "StrongPass123"
}

### Audit logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Block user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create credit package
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/credit-packages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Local 100",
  "creditAmount": 100,
  "bonusCreditAmount": 10,
  "priceMinor": 499,
  "currency": "USD",
  "isActive": true
}

### Grant credits
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/credit-accounts/{{userId}}/grant
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100,
  "reason": "Local integration testing",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{idempotencyKey}}-grant"
}

### Admin AI statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/ai-requests/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: invalid adjustment amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/credit-accounts/{{userId}}/deduct
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -1,
  "reason": "Expected validation error",
  "idempotencyKey": "{{idempotencyKey}}-invalid"
}
